    "created_at": "2016-08-30T02:27:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-30T02:27:08Z",
    "body": "@bholley knows this stuff better than I do.  But afaict in Firefox any operation on a property on a cross-origin window first asks a general \"can I operate on this property?\" question and that will throw for all properties that are not in the whitelisted set.\n\nI don't know that I have a strong opinion about whether to throw in this situation or not.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
