    "created_at": "2016-08-30T02:29:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-30T02:29:26Z",
    "body": "Oh, and I guess in Gecko the question is actually \"can I perform verb X on this property?\" where the possible verbs are get, set, call, enumerate, get property descriptor.  delete uses the \"set\" verb at the moment.\n\nFundamentally, if `foo.bar = undefined` throws (even in non-strict mode), then it feels like `delete foo.bar` should throw too.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
