    "created_at": "2016-08-30T05:35:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-30T05:35:18Z",
    "body": "https://tc39.github.io/ecma262/#sec-invariants-of-the-essential-internal-methods says [[Delete]] must return a Boolean, but I think that section also allows exceptions although it's not explicitly stated. [[Delete]] can certainly throw already anyway.\n\nSo I guess we should change this if implementations already throw. And we should probably test indexed properties before doing that. It seems the test does not cover them.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
